%% UC-28 — Configure platform settings — admin only
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel (Settings page)
    participant B as Backend (adminRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    A->>AP: Open Settings (researcher users are redirected to /access-denied)
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/settings
    B->>M: find(admin_settings)
    B-->>AP: key-value configuration
    A->>AP: Change a setting
    AP->>B: PUT /api/v1/admin/settings/:key {value}
    B->>B: requireRole(ROLES.ADMIN)
    B->>M: upsert(admin_settings, {key})
    B-->>AP: 200 setting applied
